  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IT (agri)tech contextual analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to analyse and map the digital landscape, the tech private sector landscape in Tunisia in relation to private sector development and business opportunities for Dutch companies. This sound context analysis is crucial as it provides a comprehensive understanding of the specific conditions, factors, and dynamics influencing digitalisation and in particular green- and (agri)tech private sector in Tunisia. The analysis serves as a foundation for informed decision-making, strategic planning, and effective resource allocation, ensuring that digitalisation efforts align with the local context.</narrative>
  </description>
